==Trivia==
*Shin Godzilla has the longest standing range of any enemy in the game.
**Shin Godzilla also has the second highest max [[Long Distance]] range in the game, with [[Filibuster Obstructa]] and [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]] in first place.
*This enemy, the three Winds ([[White Wind|White]], [[Red Wind|Red]], [[Dark Wind|Dark]]), [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]] and [[Elder Flame Doron]] are the only enemies which don't have a soul when they die.
*This enemy's base money drop of 1,954¢ is a reference to the year the first [[wikipedia:Godzilla (franchise)|Godzilla]] film was released.
*Shin Godzilla in [[God of Destruction (Merciless)]] has 1,200,000 AP, the highest out of any collab enemy.

